---
const { extras = false } = Astro.props;
---
<aside class="rounded-2xl bg-paper p-6 soft-shadow lg:sticky lg:top-28"><h2 class="display text-3xl">Resumen de tu reserva</h2><div class="mt-6 flex gap-4 border-b border-stone-200 pb-5"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618773928121-c32242e63f39?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=85" alt="Suite Botánica" class="h-20 w-28 rounded-xl object-cover"/><div><h3 class="display text-xl">Suite Botánica</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-stone-500">2 huéspedes · 1 cama King · 32 m²</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 border-b border-stone-200 py-5 text-xs"><div><p class="text-stone-500">Entrada</p><b>12 Ago 2026</b></div><div><p class="text-stone-500">Salida</p><b>15 Ago 2026</b></div><div><p class="text-stone-500">Noches</p><b>3 noches</b></div></div>{extras&&<div class="space-y-3 border-b border-stone-200 py-5 text-xs"><div class="flex justify-between"><span>Tour Viñedos Premium</span><b>$42.000</b></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span>Masaje relajante</span><b>$55.000</b></div></div>}<div class="space-y-3 py-5 text-sm"><div class="flex justify-between"><span>Subtotal habitación</span><b>$435.000</b></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span>Impuestos y cargos</span><b>$65.250</b></div></div><div class="flex items-end justify-between rounded-xl bg-[#f4ead9] p-4"><b>Total a pagar</b><p class="display text-3xl">${extras?'597.250':'500.250'}</p></div><div class="mt-5 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 p-4 text-xs"><b class="text-forest">◇ Reserva segura</b><p class="mt-1 text-stone-500">Tus datos están protegidos con cifrado de nivel bancario.</p></div></aside>
